  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ariphomala kufundza, watserera kula gambani, kuno kundi kulu ra atu kala rinamlunga-lunga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi phakala na mutu mmwenga ambaye kala ana mahana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mutu wa",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "mahana",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "kala ni najisi, kpwa hivyo kala karuhusiwa kuinjira nyumba ya kuvoya Mlungu, kuguta ama kugutwa ni myawe. Na achiphozwa kala ni akadzionyese kpwa mlavyadzi-sadaka, ndipho aweze kutsanganyikana na atu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mutu hiye wakpwedzachita mavwindi mbere za Jesu achimuamba, “Bwana, uchimendza, unaweza kunitakasa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Jesu wagolosa mkpwonowe achimguta yuya mutu wa mahana, achimuamba, “Ehe! Nalonda, takasika.” Achiphola phapho kpwa phapho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.14.1+LEV.14.2+LEV.14.3+LEV.14.4+LEV.14.5+LEV.14.6+LEV.14.7+LEV.14.8+LEV.14.9+LEV.14.10+LEV.14.11+LEV.14.12+LEV.14.13+LEV.14.14+LEV.14.15+LEV.14.16+LEV.14.17+LEV.14.18+LEV.14.19+LEV.14.20+LEV.14.21+LEV.14.22+LEV.14.23+LEV.14.24+LEV.14.25+LEV.14.26+LEV.14.27+LEV.14.28+LEV.14.29+LEV.14.30+LEV.14.31+LEV.14.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Alawi 14:1–32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Jesu achimuamba, “Sikiza, usimuambire mutu yeyesi! Ela phiya ukadzionyese kpwa mlavyadzi-sadaka, na ulavye sadaka ya kutakaswa dza vyolagiza Musa, ili ukale ushaidi kpwa atu kala ukaphola kpweli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badaye, Jesu waphiya mudzi wa Kaperinaumu. Ariphokala anainjira mudzi hinyo, mkpwulu wa jeshi ra Chirumi wamlunga achimvoya amterye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achiamba, “Bwana, mtumishi wangu arere hiko kaya kadziweza, analumwa sana mana ana ukongo wa kuphola vilungo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu achimuamba, “Haya nkasikira ndakpwedza nimphoze.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela yuya mkpwulu wa jeshi wamuamba, “Bwana, sifwaha kukukaribisha mwangu nyumbani. Nakuvoya ugombe neno tu, na mtumishi wangu andaphola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana hata mimi ni tsini ya akulu angu, nami nina asikari ambao a tsini yangu. Nchimuamba mmwenga, ‘Phiya phatu fulani!’ Anaphiya; na wanjina nchimuamba, ‘Ndzo!’ Aredza. Piya nchimuamba mtumishi wangu, ‘Henda utu fulani!’ Naye anahenda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ariphomsikira, waangalala na achiaambira hara atu kala anamlunga-lunga achiamba, “Nakuambirani kpweli kukala sidzangbweona mutu ariye na imani dza ihi mumu tsi ya Iziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.13.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 13:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakuambirani kukala atu anji kula mlairo wa dzuwa na mtswerero wa dzuwa andakpwedza karamuni phamwenga na Burahimu, Isaka na Jakobo kpwenye ufalume wa Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.22.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 22:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.25.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "25:30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.13.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 13:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela nyo Aiziraeli ariotsambulwa ni Mlungu andatsuphiwa kondze jizani ambako andarira na kusaga meno.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Jesu achimuamba yuya mkpwulu wa jeshi, “Phiya vyako, na indakala uchivyoamini.” Naye mtumishiwe achiphola wakati uho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ariphofika nyumbani kpwa Petero, wakpwendakuta mtsedza mchetu wa Petero arere chitandani ana homa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamguta mkpwono yuya mchetu, na homa richiphola, achiunuka achiandza kumuhumikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iriphofika dziloni wareherwa atu anji okala ana pepho. Naye achiatuluza pepho kpwa uwezo wa nenore. Piya waphoza atu osi ambao kala ni akongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.53.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isaya 53:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi gosi higa gahendeka ili ritimiye rira neno rogombwa ni nabii Isaya, roamba, “Wahuusira unyonje wehu na makongo gehu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Jesu ariphoona kukala borori ra atu rikamzunguluka, waambira anafundzie avuke ngʼambo ya ziya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phapho hipho mwalimu mmwenga wa Shariya waphiya kpwa Jesu achendamuamba, “Mwalimu, mino nindakulunga kokosi ndikophiya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu achimuamba, “Makala gakala winani, na nyama a mapha ana nyumba zao, ela mimi, Mutu Yela Mlunguni, sina phatu pha kuika mbavu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanafundzi wanjina achiamba, “Bwana, niricha kpwandza nkazike baba ndipho nedze nikulunge.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Jesu achimuamba, “Nilunga na ariche atu ambao taamkuluphira Mlungu adzishuulishe na mambo dza higo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ariphoinjira dauni, anafundzie amlunga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariphokala anaphiya, kpwazuka phuto kali sana hiko ziyani, hata maimbi gachiandza kufwinika dau. Ela wakati gaga ganahendeka, Jesu kala arere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anafundzie akpwendamlamusa, kuno anaamba, “Bwana, hutivye, hunahoha!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye achiaambira, “Mwi atu msioamini, mbona mu aoga?” Phahi waunuka na achidemurira rira phuto na go maimbi, gachihurira hu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hara atu achiangalala, achiuzana, “Ni mutu wa viphi yuno ambaye anasikizwa hata ni phuto na maimbi?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariphofika ngʼambo ya ziya, uphande wa tsi ya Agerasi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:28",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Maandiko ganjina nkuiha tsi hino",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gadara",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "au",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gerigesa.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Jesu wakutana na atu airi ariotuluka kula vikurani. Atu hinyo kala ana pepho na kala anatisha hata taphana ariyekubali kutsupira njira hiyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao achikota kululu achiamba, “Hukakukosani we Mwana wa Mlungu? Dze, ukedzahugayisa kabila ya wakati kufika?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phephi na phapho kala phana chaa cha nguluwe anji chinarisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi hara pepho amvoya ruhusa Jesu achimuamba, “Ichikala undahulavya mirini mwa hinya atu, huinjize mura nguluweni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu achiaambira, “Haya phiyani.” Hara pepho atuluka achendainjira hara nguluwe. Chaa chosi chatserera mairo mteremukoni, chichiinjira ziyani, na nguluwe osi achihoha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hara arisa ariphoona hivyo azola kuphiya mudzini, achendasema gosi garigokala gakahendeka na gara goaphaha hara atu okala ana pepho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi atu a mudzi wosi akpwedzamlola Jesu, na ariphomuona amvoya auke tsi yao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
